TEXT sec=s2 slot=eyebrow text="Selected pieces"
TEXT sec=s2 slot=title text="The chair that defines your room"
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Eames lounge replica" body="A bent plywood shell wrapped in leather, finished with a walnut veneer edge."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Industrial stool" body="Cast iron legs welded to an oak seat, limited run of forty units only."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Desk lamp unit" body="Adjustable arm mechanism mounted on a steel base, priced by the fixture."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Side table model" body="Solid ash construction with brass hardware, available for immediate shipping."
