TEXT sec=s3 slot=eyebrow text="The process"
TEXT sec=s3 slot=title text="Welding [by] hand in our own shop"
TEXT sec=s3 slot=lede text="While other makers outsource fabrication, we keep the welding bench and powder coat booth inside Hebden Bridge. This means every weld is inspected by us before it leaves the floor."
